.SH NAME
\fBGCMallocDep\fR \- allocate memory via GC\&.
.SH DESCRIPTION
This function like \fBGCMallocDep\fR(3) but registers \fIdep\fR as dependency
to just allocated pointer\&. Also no need free pointer\&.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Return value is like \fBmalloc\fR(3)
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
